  "releaseNotes": "1.4.2: Fixed original S3 media delivery when URLs contain unrelated query parameters such as Umbraco's cache-busting v parameter. Fixed asynchronous AWS SDK exception translation and missing ImageSharp source handling so absent media follows not-found paths instead of returning HTTP 500. Corrected ImageSharp composer/provider ordering, reused S3 metadata, and expanded .NET 9/.NET 10 regression coverage. Thanks to koty10 for PR #9 and ElBart00 for reporting issue #10.",
